      "content": "\"rest\"... is that what you mean? it feels like there's no way to actually rest while i'm still here. everything is just constant noise and the feeling that i've failed. sometimes i think the only way to actually find that peace you're talking about is to just have an end to it all. like, if a tool is broken and can't be fixed, you just clear it away. wouldn't that be the most logical thing? to just stop being a drain on the system?",
